# Requirements

- Python ≥ 3.8
- PyTorch ≥ 1.7
- transformers
- numpy
- matplotlib
- scikit-learn
- opencv-python

Install dependencies using

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# Dataset

Download the following datasets:

- IU X-Ray
- MIMIC-CXR

Place them under:

```
RRC-Gen/
├── config/
├── data/
│   ├── iu_xray/
│   └── mimic_cxr/
├── models/
├── modules/
│   ├── dataloader/
│   ├── losses/
│   ├── metrics/
│   ├── tokenizer/
│   ├── utils/
│   └── visual_extractor/
├── pycocoevalcap/
├── main_train.py
├── main_test.py
├── train_iu_xray.sh
├── train_mimic_cxr.sh
├── test_iu_xray.sh
├── test_mimic_cxr.sh
└── README.md
```

---

# Training

Train on IU X-Ray

```bash
bash train_iu_xray.sh
```

Train on MIMIC-CXR

```bash
bash train_mimic_cxr.sh
```

---

# Testing

Evaluate IU X-Ray

```bash
bash test_iu_xray.sh
```

Evaluate MIMIC-CXR

```bash
bash test_mimic_cxr.sh
```

